# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.csproj.user
# Visual Studio 的機器本地檔（*.user 慣例）：內容是本機還原狀態的時間戳，
# 對其他人 clone 下來沒有意義，且會因每個人的操作而互相覆蓋
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# Build outputs
bin/
obj/
publish/

# Rider
.idea/

# VS Code
.vscode/

# NuGet
*.nupkg
packages/
project.lock.json

# User-specific files
*.log
secrets.json
appsettings.json
appsettings.*.json

# Environment variables / Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Rider / ReSharper / dotCover
_ReSharper*/
*.DotSettings.user
*.dotCover

# Publish/Deployment
*.Publish.xml

# Misc
*.db
*.pfx
*.key
*.pem

# Owner-local session bootstrap (hardcodes local docs-folder path, same "本機不進 repo" convention as SA/SD docx)
CLAUDE.md

# Claude Code Browser 預覽工具設定（只有 AI 工具會用，owner 手動起服務不需要這個檔案）
.claude/launch.json
